Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.77,0:00:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.65,0:00:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling there's a lot\Nmore at stake here than we think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will require some explaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While all VRMMOs originate\Nfrom the SEED program,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a difference between\Nthem and Elvime Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.79,0:00:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a stripped-down version of the Cardinal\NSystem runs the other active VR Miss,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the one that operates\Nthis game is a copy of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the full-spec version\Nthat ran Sword Art Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full-spec version?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.79,0:00:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The original Cardinal System had a feature
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.65,0:00:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which could automatically generate quests.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would log onto the net\Nand search for various
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,legends and folklore\Nfrom around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it would take the stories it found,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,adapt the data, and use it to\Ngenerate an infinite number of quests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.91,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this quest, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.81,0:01:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it auto-generated by Cardinal 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After seeing how that NPC was acting\Njust now, I have a feeling it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that is the case here,\Nthen no matter what you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.79,0:01:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this quest will end the\Nsame way the myth does.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just now, I ran a quick\Ncheck on my archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to my data,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in taking into account the\NNorse mythology ALO is based on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.01,0:01:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this quest must end in a final war event.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.53,0:01:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Frost Giants from\NJotunheim and Niflheim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.41,0:01:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aren't the only ones\Nwho want to attack Arun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.79,0:01:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Below Niflheim is a fiery realm called\NMuspelheim, where the Flame Giants live.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.73,0:01:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the myth, they will attack\Nthe World Tree and burn it to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.99,0:01:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ragnarok, the twilight of the gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.27,0:01:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.18,0:01:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this game system\Nwould destroy its own maps on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.31,0:01:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got to be a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:02:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but there's\Nno mistake about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.79,0:02:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Cardinal System has the authority\Nto destroy its maps if it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this because the original Cardinal\NSystem's last task was destroying Aincrad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the floating castle of Sword Art Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There goes my blacksmith shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There go my chances of\Never meeting my soulmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if this Ragnarok\Nhappens and it all deletes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't the server be rolled back the way\Nit was from one of the backups it's made?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The system has an auto-backup\Nfeature, but those files won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.31,0:02:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only saves player data, not field\Ndata, so you can't restore everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.61,0:02:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.27,0:02:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop razzing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.87,0:02:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was trying to call a GM to\Nsee if he knew about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:02:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It ain't happening now.
