Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.83,0:02:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's after hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.35,0:03:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Support's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Sunday morning\Njust before New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.78,0:03:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry and get to\Nthe last level. Right!
