Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.03,0:04:49.03,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,765)\blur3\bord6\fs180\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\alpha&H22&}King Of The Giants
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't looking good. The gold one's\Ntough. Nothing we do is slowing him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.37,0:05:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we only had a mage who can\Ncast attack spells in our party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's hilarious coming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't help anyway\Nbecause the dude in the back
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the high resistance to\Nmagic would just move up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this get any tougher?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shockwave attack coming\Nup in three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.23,0:06:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Su-phila-heil-a-gul-austul!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flatsubal-a-bani!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.21,0:06:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only got about two and a\Nhalf minutes before I'm out of MP!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.47,0:06:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto, more than two-thirds\Nof this medallion's gone dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we die now, we won't have time\Nto start over from the save point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.93,0:06:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Good to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one thing we haven't tried yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we use sword skills with magic, we\Nmight do some damage to this gold bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll leave you wide open, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's do or die time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.39,0:06:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you say we focus\Nour attack and wipe him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.63,0:06:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just say the word and his ass is grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:06:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silica, time for your bubble spell. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, and hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tina, bubble breath attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.51,0:07:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.95,0:08:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We locked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.11,0:08:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how it comes to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.05,0:09:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For this world, for this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for this world, for this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.27,0:09:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, we killed your pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what the hell was\Nthat move you just pulled?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was totally a new skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not really a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's skill connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skill connect?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember the last update?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it brought a bunch\Nof sword skills to ALO, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, even though we got those,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.27,0:10:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we didn't get unique skills like\Ndual wielding or the divine blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.55,0:10:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.77,0:10:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were dual wielding just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technically, that wasn't dual wielding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was using one-handed sword skills with\Neach hand and alternating between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm lucky, I can keep it going without\Nany lag maybe three or four times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.37,0:11:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, no, it's nothing,\NYui—just déjà vu is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.01,0:11:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not off the hook\Neither what the hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you do just now i\Ndon't think you want to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know oh come on i've\Nnever seen anything like
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that before it's an\Nextra skill i picked up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dual wielding don't pop
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a blood vessel all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.09,0:11:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stand around chatting all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leafa, how much time\Nwe got left? Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the pace we're going, we should\Nhave maybe another hour or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.67,0:11:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.19,0:11:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui, do you know how big these last\Ncouple of floors are going to be? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.31,0:11:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The third floor is about 70\N% the size of the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.59,0:11:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the fourth floor is pretty\Nmuch just the boss room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.65,0:11:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figure the last boss fight will\Ntake us 30 minutes to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means we only got about 30 minutes\Nto get to his room. That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clock's ticking and the\NKing of Giants is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.93,0:12:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's get the lead out\Nand kick his giant ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as everyone's got their HP and\NMP restored, we'll hit that third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Ah, ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, the last boss is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.03,0:13:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a trap. It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's an NPC.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.63,0:13:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her core programming is connected to the\Nlanguage engine module, just like ORTs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, there is one\Ndifference between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one has an HP gauge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:14:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a big red flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's got an HP gauge,\Nwe might have to fight her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.09,0:14:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.89,0:14:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be a trap, it might not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, we can't\Nafford to take the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't waste any more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get to Thrimmer ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.11,0:14:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.49,0:14:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not leave me. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.55,0:14:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even if it is a trap, even if\NI know it's a trap, I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just turn my back on\Nsomeone if they need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it means we fail the quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if Arun gets destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I got a chance to do some\Ngood for someone, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:14:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because that's what being\Na samurai is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.45,0:15:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.25,0:15:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.37,0:15:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, fairy swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me help you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.29,0:15:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can manage it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way out's kinda far, Dollface.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.79,0:15:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna be okay to make it on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could, but I'm afraid I cannot\Nleave the castle just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you see, I must first retrieve my\Npeople's treasure, which King Thrym stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would, fairy swordsman, please\Nlet me accompany you to Thrimmer's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.21,0:15:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is beyond fishy,\Ndon't you think? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:16:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I can't stand seeing you beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we only got a little\Nfurther to go before the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.11,0:16:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and seeing as how we don't\Nknow for sure it's a trap...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.21,0:16:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're coming with us, gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll help you beat that jerk, Thrimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.97,0:16:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in the same boat now,\Nso let's get wet together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, fairy swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.17,0:16:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delete Klein's last comment\Nfrom your memory, Yui. Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.24,0:16:34.28,UI,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1419,1042.5)\c&H959192&\blur0.9\fry180\fscx33\fscy33\shad0\clip(1028,1008,1454,1068)}An NPC wishes to join your party. \N\N\N\N\NWill you accept?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.28,0:16:35.20,UI,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1419,1042.5)\c&H959192&\blur0.9\fry180\fscx33\fscy33\shad0}An NPC wishes to join your party. \N\N\N\N\NWill you accept?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.95,UI,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(405,534)\c&H948B7E&\fscy100\fscx100\blur1.5\frz24\fay0.06\fax0\4c&HE0D9CC&\alpha&H40&}An NPC wishes to join your party. \N\N\N\N\NWill you accept?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.95,0:16:36.99,UI,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(482.67,505.33)\fscy89.3\fscx82\c&H948B7E&\blur1.5\frz24\fay0.06\fax0\4c&HE0D9CC&\alpha&H40&}An NPC wishes to join your party. \N\N\N\N\N\NWill you accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, she must be a mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her MP is really high.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the way they got\Nthis dungeon laid out,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the final boss room should\Nbe down those stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, he's the last boss, so he's going\Nto be way stronger than the other ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you hit him, hit fast and hit hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until we can figure out\Nhis attack patterns,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll be on the defensive\Nso no one moves on until I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say one last thing if you see\Nhis gauge drop to yellow or
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.29,0:17:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,red his attack patterns are\Ngonna change big time so watch
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out this is it guys get in\Nthere and give it all you got
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.13,0:18:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She boosted our maximum HP.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know a spell could do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.43,0:18:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cha-cha-ching!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.89,0:18:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how much Yule's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coo-chee-coo-chee-coo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who let the flies in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The buzzing of their\Nwings is so irritating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall crush them all before\Nthey annoy me any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it, Alfheim, insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.33,0:19:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you burrowed down here on\Nthe whims of Oort, the Trollope?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wretches, how dare you enter here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.85,0:19:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think you could steal my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you tell me where I can find that\Nwoman, I shall give it all to you gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.49,0:19:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think a samurai\Ngives a damn about gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.41,0:19:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can stick that\Ntreasure right up your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.01,0:19:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better yet, let me give you a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Freya, how good of you to\Ngrace us with your presence today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you have left your cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I take it you have come to your\Nsenses and agreed to become my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's supposed to marry you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.53,0:20:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why she came to this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.15,0:20:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, my dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the night before\Nour wedding banquet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caught her sniffing around my treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As punishment, I locked\Nher in a cage of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.49,0:20:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kazuto, I know this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.37,0:20:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I read it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.91,0:20:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thrymmer and Freya, a stolen treasure,\Nand something else, too. But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not become your wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.13,0:20:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These warriors and I are here to\Nput an end to your reign of evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Return my treasure immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the spirit, my lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would expect nothing\Nless from the woman whose
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beauty and valor are\Nknown throughout the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as they say, the more noble the\Nflower, the more satisfying it is to pluck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I've snuffed the\Nlife from these insects,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.99,0:21:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall shower you with extra affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.23,0:21:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over my dead body!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Lord Klein, won't let you\Nlay a finger on Lady Freya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to the angry\Nlittle fly buzzing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.69,0:21:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, it is time I began celebrating
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.89,0:21:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my conquest of Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.05,0:21:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall start by crushing\Nthe life from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.11,0:21:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.59,0:21:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to Yui, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.45,0:21:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't attack, Doshi says! You guys!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.57,0:22:09.32,ED-En-purp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}You need a time machine?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.62,0:22:20.58,ED-En-Asuna,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}We stand side by side with our carefree faces
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.62,0:22:20.58,ED-Rom-Asuna,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k50\blur2}Su{\k42}ki {\k26}da{\k33}ra{\k49}ke {\k175}no {\k24}ka{\k43}o {\k27}na{\k39}ra{\k45}be{\k143}te
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.58,0:22:27.59,ED-En-Sugu,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Talking about the same old things
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.58,0:22:27.59,ED-Rom-Sugu,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k47\blur2}I{\k49}tsu{\k22}mo {\k44}to {\k44}o{\k42}na{\k130}ji {\k25}ha{\k15}na{\k41}shi {\k54}shi{\k188}te
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.09,0:22:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same thing as you talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TV in the middle.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.59,0:22:39.73,ED-En-Silica,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}While the heroes on TV look busy as they fight for the future
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.59,0:22:39.73,ED-Rom-Silica,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k53\blur2}Te{\k43}re{\k17}bi {\k48}no {\k44}na{\k167}ka {\k30}hi{\k46}i{\k21}ro{\k42}o {\k45}ga {\k65}mi{\k24}ra{\k41}i {\k45}no {\k46}ta{\k43}me {\k42}ni {\k40}i{\k136}so{\k10}ga{\k20}shi {\k58}so{\k87}u
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.09,0:22:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heroes are for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.09,0:22:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.43,0:22:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other place to live?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.73,0:22:47.78,ED-En-Bestgirl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}It feels cozy here with you, more than anywhere else
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.73,0:22:47.78,ED-Rom-Bestgirl,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k52\blur2}Ho{\k23}ka {\k21}ni {\k20}wa {\k90}nai {\k23}i{\k21}go{\k37}ko{\k72}chi {\k23}ga {\k43}a{\k42}ru{\k238}yo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.78,0:22:56.66,ED-En-Asuna,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(200,200)\blur2}What can I do? I used to like being alone, but I can't go back to that time
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.78,0:22:56.66,ED-Rom-Asuna,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(200,200)\k41\blur2}Ma{\k30}i{\k42}ru{\k83}naa {\k25}hi{\k24}to{\k42}ri {\k57}ga {\k29}su{\k49}ki {\k36}da{\k28}tta {\k87}no {\k110}ni {\k43}mou {\k23}mo{\k23}do{\k20}re {\k23}na{\k73}i
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.66,0:23:02.46,ED-En-purp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Even when we have our silly little chats
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.66,0:23:02.46,ED-Rom-Purp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k56\blur2}Ta{\k47}a{\k42}i {\k43}no {\k45}na{\k40}i {\k26}ji{\k42}kan {\k24}wo {\k42}wa{\k23}ke {\k22}a{\k128}i
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.29,0:22:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.69,0:23:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.09,0:23:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.46,0:23:10.63,ED-En-purp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}We don't say we're happy or sad, because we're so much alike
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.46,0:23:10.63,ED-Rom-Purp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k25\blur2}U{\k13}re{\k53}shii{\k22}yo {\k23}to{\k35}ka {\k30}sa{\k11}bi{\k54}shii{\k21}yo {\k23}to{\k44}ka {\k23}ni{\k21}ta {\k21}mo{\k22}no {\k32}dou{\k56}shi {\k43}da{\k44}ka{\k66}ra {\k22}i{\k22}wa{\k23}na{\k68}i
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.63,0:23:16.47,ED-En-purp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}Those days like an adventure movie have long since gone
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.63,0:23:16.47,ED-Rom-Purp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k61\blur2}Bou{\k46}ken {\k43}ei{\k44}ga {\k44}to {\k43}wa {\k22}to{\k44}o{\k22}i {\k43}ma{\k22}i{\k15}ni{\k52}chi {\k83}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.41,0:23:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.47,0:23:27.86,ED-En-purp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,800)\blur2}But I hope this overwhelming flood of fond remembrances never ends
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.47,0:23:27.86,ED-Rom-Purp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,800)\k24\blur2}A{\k21}ki{\k33}re{\k35}ru {\k23}you {\k43}na {\k22}a{\k22}fu{\k44}re{\k21}ru {\k23}you {\k43}na {\k22}o{\k21}mo{\k21}i{\k27}da{\k18}shi {\k22}wa{\k44}ra{\k43}i {\k42}ga {\k22}tsu{\k24}zu{\k23}ki {\k16}ma{\k27}su {\k27}you {\k334}ni
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.61,0:23:35.03,ED-En-purp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}You need a time machine?
